# NOTE: the previous line here was  "*.png"  (with literal quote characters).
# Quotes are not special in .gitignore, so that pattern matched files literally
# named  "something.png"  and never ignored a single real PNG. It has been removed.
#
# Do NOT ignore *.png here: index.html loads ccna.png, img.png and img2.png,
# so they must stay in the repo for GitHub Pages to serve them.
# If you want to keep new screenshots out of the repo, uncomment the next line:
# Screenshot*.png
